# Brand Foundation Phase

Invoke when the user runs `website-brand-foundation` or asks for palette, moodboard, inspo analysis, or look-and-feel before build.

## Phase gate

**Foundation only.** Do NOT scaffold routes, edit `src/**`, or run `npm dev` until the user approves a direction and invokes `website-frontend-build`.

## Skills to read (every foundation run)

| Skill | Path / trigger | Role |
|-------|----------------|------|
| **website-brand-foundation** | `~/.cursor/skills/website-brand-foundation/SKILL.md` | Primary workflow |
| **canvas** | `~/.cursor/skills-cursor/canvas/SKILL.md` | Brand Direction Canvas |
| **firecrawl** | Firecrawl plugin skill | Scrape fallback, bulk text |
| **browser-automation** | Browse plugin skill | Fallback browser MCP |
| **united-strength-brand** | `.cursor/skills/united-strength-brand/SKILL.md` | Project brand context (this client) |
| **high-end-minimalist-ui** | `.cursor/skills/high-end-minimalist-ui/SKILL.md` | Editorial spacing, section rhythm |
| **luxury-motion-micro-interactions** | `.cursor/skills/luxury-motion-micro-interactions/SKILL.md` | Motion pacing (600–800ms) |
| **premium-mobile-touch-ux** | `.cursor/skills/premium-mobile-touch-ux/SKILL.md` | Mobile nav / drawer for sitemap notes |
| **high-performance-media** | `.cursor/skills/high-performance-media/SKILL.md` | Hero video/still guidance |
| **knowledge-capture** | Notion plugin skill | Optional Notion export |
| **create-rule** | `~/.cursor/skills-cursor/create-rule/SKILL.md` | Validate brand-tokens.mdc |

**Not in foundation phase:** `website-frontend-build` (build phase only).

